ation/source149-152-sol-20261116/SOURCE_PACKET_FINAL.json",
                  "userEnteredValue": {
                    "stringValue": "16 November 2026 update: Published on AlecKriebel.com after full original manuscript review and editorial adoption. The live unchanged four-page PDF displays on desktop and at390px; direct-open and completed PDF/ZIP downloads were checked byte for byte. Full original positive-norm/telescoping theorem, exact source abstract, prior credit and native version1.0 retained; no individual-sum constancy or firstness claim. Current47 legacy HTML articles gave no genuine corresponding page; no redirect invented. No qualifying follow-up. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/9d9c389718f51d9f2dd8abf603c84169cdabb9ea/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-focal-kato-supercritical-publication-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\n16 November 2026 update: Full original regular closed-orbit theorem passed source-first, independent and adversarial review. The positive focal antipedal norm-difference identity telescopes for all admitted odd, star, reversed and repeated orbits. Strict elliptic caustics and nonretracing are essential; no individual-sum constancy, hyperbolic/degenerate extension or firstness claim is made. The actual k603 observation/positive norms and known height product were checked in primary sources. One unchanged native finite diagnostic passed as supplementary evidence. No repair, narrowing or qualifying follow-up. Canonical remains blank until publication and live verification. Scientific evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/4437b1f3b853983daf0616bfb1e8af23b542c647/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23191247-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nPublished Zenodo manuscript, exact native edition and original assets acquired. Substantive full-manuscript review has begun with separate independent and adversarial approaches. Root's own source-first review and final scientific disposition remain pending; no live page or canonical assigned. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/035230f35bc6b3e38e84b0e2a51200613c49904a/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/source149-152-sol-20261116/SOURCE_PACKET_FINAL.json"
                  },
