                {
                  "formattedValue": "16 November 2026 update: Published on AlecKriebel.com after full original manuscript review and editorial adoption. The live unchanged four-page PDF displays on desktop and at390px; direct-open and completed PDF/ZIP downloads were checked byte for byte. Full three-kernel counterexample at allowed n=1 and separate positive n=0 boundary retained, with prior ALO-generator credit. Native version1.0.0 is metadata only; no firstness or final-typeset equivalence claim. Current47 legacy HTML articles gave no genuine corresponding page; no redirect invented. No qualifying follow-up. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/9d9c389718f51d9f2dd8abf603c84169cdabb9ea/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-focal-kato-supercritical-publication-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\n16 November 2026 update: Full original counterexample to the sum of all three Kato kernels passed source-first, independent and adversarial review at the original allowed index n=1. The binary quasilinear function-field convention, anisotropy, all-rational-parameter norm/residue obstruction and separately positive n=0 proposition were checked. The mixed generator is explicitly prior ALO work; no firstness, all-index failure or final-typeset-body equivalence is claimed. One unchanged native finite algebra diagnostic passed; it is not a cohomology decision oracle. No repair, narrowing or qualifying follow-up. Native version 1.0.0 is metadata; the PDF prints no numeric version. Canonical remains blank until publication and live verification. Scientific evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/4437b1f3b853983daf0616bfb1e8af23b542c647/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23444050-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete 4-page manuscript and 299-line controlling TeX acquired with unchanged checksum-verified native files. Native record created 18 October 2026 at 00:29:32 UTC; declared publication da