                  "formattedValue": "16 November 2026 update: Full original uniform-Boolean-cube theorem passed manuscript, independent and adversarial review. For nonzero real multilinear degree-at-most-d polynomials, pointwise disjoint supports force a coordinate relative influence >=1/(1024d^8); every influence <=1/(4096d^8) guarantees a common nonzero vertex. Normalization includes the constant coefficient. The credited Li–Li–Li–Liu separator, real OSSS covariance and classical Markov inputs are prior work; the contribution is their explicit target-specific deduction. Root's informed review discloses pre-INITIAL scope-outline exposure; the two scientific families were independent. One unchanged finite native diagnostic corroborated the proof. No repair, narrowing, firstness, broader-measure claim or qualifying follow-up. Page preparing; canonical blank until live verification. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/9d9c389718f51d9f2dd8abf603c84169cdabb9ea/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23443301-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete four-page native manuscript and 288-line controlling TeX acquired with checksum-bound original files. Native creation: 17 October 2026 at 23:12:45 UTC. Independent scope and adversarial review packets are frozen. Root has read the full manuscript and frozen an informed reconstruction, with prior scope-outline exposure disclosed; final comparison remains pending. No scientific disposition or public page approved; canonical remains blank. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/65256bfa6661c2965226bfaa1ca65ce6c551904f/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-source156-adoption-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nPublished paper record with checksum-bound manuscript; deep review still required.",
