                  },
                  "effectiveValue": {
                    "stringValue": "16 November 2026 update: Substantive review has begun with two separate independent and adversarial source-first families. Each read the complete six-page manuscript and388-line controlling TeX and froze its own INITIAL before peer opinions. Post-INITIAL primary/support work is recorded; final comparison and root's own source-first review remain pending. No original-claim disposition or public page is approved; canonical remains blank. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/9d9c389718f51d9f2dd8abf603c84169cdabb9ea/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-source156-adoption-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete six-page native manuscript and 388-line controlling TeX acquired with checksum-bound original files. Native creation: 15 October 2026 at 14:26:52 UTC. Source-only acquisition is complete; substantive mathematical review has not begun and this paper remains queued. No scientific disposition or public page approved; canonical remains blank. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/65256bfa6661c2965226bfaa1ca65ce6c551904f/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-source156-adoption-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nPublished paper record with checksum-bound manuscript; deep review still required."
